   "reason": "The bishop crosses on diagonals through pillared terrain a rook can never pass, and Swap converts his position into Rookie's position with her turn intact — the archetype Tyler named. | A rabid piece picks the nearest target and Smoke deletes Rookie from its target list entirely (rabidAction returns no Rookie target while smoked), so the maddened piece can only eat its own side while nothing hunts Rookie and the king does not flee.",
