    "boulder+convert"
   ],
   "reason": "The Squire jumps over walls and blockers that stop every sliding form; Swap then makes his landing square Rookie's, which is the only way she crosses a fully blocked rank without spending a knight transform. | A converted pen pawn becomes a rainbow ally standing inside the room whose attack squares the king refuses to enter, and Boulder seals whatever squares the ally does not cover; between them the king's flight set can be driven to zero without a capture.",
